		<node id="n1">
			<data key="d0">1</data>
			<data key="d3"><![CDATA[<div style="background-color: #2F2F2F; color: #DFC590; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><b style="color: #E4AB04; font-size: 20px;">POWER PARRY</b>


Your Parry Power is increased by 10% / 20% / 30%.

Parry
You can block when equipped with any Melee weapon,
Ward, or Shield. A well-timed block will parry the
attack and fill up the enemy's Stun Bar.
Wait to see a flash on the enemy or projectile to
perform a parry.

Overpower
Attacking blocking enemies or parrying their attacks
fills their Stun Bar until they become overpowered.
Overpowered enemies are open for Merciless Attacks.


(1 per level, max level 3)</div>]]></data>
