Perform a Merciless Attack by pressing [Contextual
Action] to deal +500% damage to an overpowered enemy.

Overpower
Attacking blocking enemies or parrying their attacks
fills their Stun Bar until they become overpowered.
Overpowered enemies are open for Merciless Attacks.

Wands, Staves and Bows cannot perform Merciless
Attacks.


(2)</div>]]></data>
