Parrying enemy attacks bashes them for 10 / 20 / 30
Blunt damage. Bash damage is increased by your Strength
attribute.

Parry
You can block when equipped with any Melee weapon,
Ward, or Shield. A well-timed block will parry the
attack and fill up the enemy's Stun Bar.
Wait to see a flash on the enemy or projectile to
perform a parry.


(2 per level, max level 3)</div>]]></data>
