Weakens the effect of the Wet and Soaked debuffs.
Stamina and Stamina Regeneration is reduced by 10%
instead of 20%.

Wet
Reduces Stamina and Stamina Regeneration by 30% for 15
minutes. Warmth reduces the remaining duration.

Soaked
Reduces Stamina and Stamina Regeneration by 30% for 30
seconds. Also reduces Ice and Shock Resistances by 30%
but increases Fire Resistance by 30%.
Soaked can be applied to enemies.
Soaked duration can not be reduced by warmth, and
transitions into the Wet debuff once it ends.


(3)</div>]]></data>
