When equipped with a Melee weapon, you can perform a
Kick by attacking while blocking.
Kicking deals little damage, but hits the target with
massive force and pushes them back, filling their Stun
Bar.
Stun Bar increase scales with Dexterity.
Stun time depends on the enemy's size.

Overpower
Attacking blocking enemies or parrying their attacks
fills their Stun Bar until they become overpowered.
Overpowered enemies are open for Merciless Attacks.


(3)</div>]]></data>
