		<node id="n119">
			<data key="d0">119</data>
			<data key="d3"><![CDATA[<div style="background-color: #2F2F2F; color: #B6E496; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><b style="color: #7CA703; font-size: 20px;">SKILL SHOT</b>


Skillshot damage is increased by 20% / 40% / 60%.

Skillshot
Striking enemy weak points, such as their heads, with
Arrows is considered a Skillshot.

Skillshots deal 100% increased base damage against
enemies without helmets and 50% against helmeted
enemies.
It can be further increased by the Skillshot damage
