20% / 40% / 60% chance to create a phantom 
decoy at your previous position for 2 seconds, 
distracting nearby enemies.

Cooldown : 15 secondes


(2 per level, max level 3)</div><p style="padding: 0px; margin: 5px; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 20px;"><hr></p><div style="background-color: #2F2F2F; color: #9FC3E9; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><b style="color: #0473C3; font-size: 20px;">DEVIOUS STRIDE</b>


